  "prefLabel": "En 902.19 Group",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 902.19 “Group” means one or more members who are customers of the same distribution utility who have signed an agreement with a host as required pursuant to RSA 362-A:9, XIV. A group can include a host and a member that are the same entity or person.\n\nSource. #14568, eff 4-27-26, EXPIRES: 4-27-36",
